  DesignSpecification:OutdoorAir,
    SZ DSOA G NW Apartment,  !- Name
    Flow/Area,               !- Outdoor Air Method
    ,                        !- Outdoor Air Flow per Person {m3/s-person}
    0.000294105,             !- Outdoor Air Flow per Zone Floor Area {m3/s-m2}  Source: xlsx raw_data!P3 Total OSA Ventilation = 0.026 m3/s (= this value x zone floor area, x multiplier for repeated floors); the xlsx lists 0 where the outdoor air is set at the air loop. Derivation of the value: xlsx Zone and HVAC System Summary Q496 (62-1999 cfm/person) = 27.5 cfm/person x 2.105 people per 1000 ft2 (2.00 people in the 949.9 ft2 of the zone) = 0.05789 cfm/ft2 x 0.000471947 m3/s per cfm / 0.09290304 m2 per ft2 = 0.000294105 m3/s-m2; the xlsx does not list the number of people of the outdoor air calculation separately: the people count here is the number that reproduces this result, and it differs from the design occupancy density N496 = 2.632 people per 1000 ft2.
    ;                        !- Outdoor Air Flow per Zone {m3/s}

