! Source for WaterHeater:Mixed (all 1 objects of this class): the xlsx gives only the HVAC system type: 15. WSHP (xlsx Zone and HVAC System Summary G495,496,497,498,499,500..., dictionary sheet 'HVAC System Type Dictionary'). The sizes, curves, flow rates, set points and node connections of the equipment are not in the documents. Kept: prototype values.
