    ,                        !- Ambient Temperature Zone Name
    ,                        !- Ambient Temperature Outdoor Air Node Name
    15.60100707829,          !- Off Cycle Loss Coefficient to Ambient Temperature {W/K}
    ,                        !- Off Cycle Loss Fraction to Zone
    15.60100707829,          !- On Cycle Loss Coefficient to Ambient Temperature {W/K}
    ,                        !- On Cycle Loss Fraction to Zone
    ,                        !- Peak Use Flow Rate {m3/s}
    ,                        !- Use Flow Rate Fraction Schedule Name
    ,                        !- Cold Water Supply Temperature Schedule Name
    SWHSys1 Pump-Water HeaterNode,  !- Use Side Inlet Node Name
